# --- @fill: hätt- + gär ------------------------------------------------------
# Each Luxembourgish distractor is a wrong person of the same conditional auxiliary.

@fill
@lu Ech [hätt] gär e Bréitchen.
@en I [would like] a bread roll.
@distractor-lu häss
@distractor-lu hätte
@distractor-lu hätten
@distractor-en will like
@distractor-en liked
@distractor-en would prefer

@fill
@lu Du [häss] gär eng Taart.
@en You [would like] a tart.
@distractor-lu hätt
@distractor-lu hätte
@distractor-lu hätten
@distractor-en will like
@distractor-en liked
@distractor-en would prefer

@fill
